  "inspector_bridge_script": {
    "file": "frontend/index.html",
    "start_line": 10,
    "end_line": 575,
    "description": "REMOVED. Historically frontend/index.html shipped an auto-injected DevTools inspector bridge: an inline <script> (formerly ~lines 10-575) that instrumented fetch / XHR / console / errors and posted events to a hard-coded external WebSocket (wss://ai-creator-backend-q677.onrender.com) plus the parent window when the SPA ran inside the inspector iframe. It was never wired into application logic — purely dev-tooling. As an unauthorized third-party tracker in production it was a security risk and has been stripped; frontend/index.html now contains only the standard Vite bootstrap. start_line/end_line above are retained as the historical range for audit reference.",
    "removed": true,
    "removed_in_task": "59e4e523",
    "harmless_at_runtime": true,
    "wired_into_app_logic": false
  },
  "duplicates_and_overlaps": [
    {
      "items": [
        "app/models/task.py::Task",
        "app/models/todo_item.py::TodoItem"
      ],
      "overlap": "title-ish text, completion state, optional due date",
      "recommendation": "keep separate",
      "rationale": "Task lives on the planner timeline (deadline, recurrence, project_id). TodoItem lives on (possibly shared) lists (list_ids M2M, parent_id). Merging would force sparse NULLs the split was designed to avoid."
    },
    {
      "items": [
        "app/models/user.py::User",
        "app/models/user_oauth.py::OAuthUser"
      ],
      "overlap": "both back JWT-authenticated callers",
      "recommendation": "reconciled via AuthContext union",
      "rationale": "Closed by audit task b7638cb2 — get_current_active/admin_user now probe via getattr so the User-side (no status column) doesn't crash on a column-loose helper."
    },
    {
      "items": [
        "app/models/finance.py::Income/Asset/FinancialAccount",
        "app/models/{income,asset,financial_account,bank_account,broker_account,exchange_account}.py"
      ],
      "overlap": "per-kind re-export wrappers around one canonical model",
      "recommendation": "wrappers stay — AC list asks for per-file imports",
      "rationale": "The kind discriminator on FinancialAccount keeps the table normalised."
    },
    {
      "items": [
        "frontend/src/pages/SmartAssistant.jsx",
        "frontend/src/pages/Recommendations.jsx"
      ],
      "overlap": "both titled 'پیشنهادات هوشمند'; both surface context recommendations",
      "recommendation": "keep separate (documented)",
      "rationale": "SmartAssistant is the live signal-entry/assistant surface; Recommendations is the history + per-type priority toggles. Distinct jobs-to-be-done; consolidating would conflate input vs review. Flagged here per the user's 'duplicate pages' concern rather than deleted."
    },
    {
      "items": [
        "route /budget",
        "route /finance"
      ],
      "overlap": "both render BudgetPage",
      "recommendation": "intentional alias",
      "rationale": "Two URLs map to one page so older /finance links keep working; not a duplicate component."
    },
    {
      "items": [
        "route /settings",
        "route /settings/ai-models",
        "route /ai-settings"
      ],
      "overlap": "Settings + AISettings cover overlapping AI-config UI",
      "recommendation": "keep separate (documented)",
      "rationale": "Settings is the consolidated hub (providers+models+prompt); AISettings is the focused AI page. Aliases /settings/ai-models → Settings preserve deep links. Documented, not removed."
    }
  ],
  "plan_for_consolidation": [
    "Lift the (is_completed, is_starred, due_date) triple from Task/TodoItem into a mixin under app/models/_common.py so future entities reuse it.",
    "Replace add_column-IF-NOT-EXISTS startup blocks with proper Alembic revisions once production stabilises (init_db docstring documents the current dev-only contract).",
    "Group the AI surface (/ai/generate, /ai/configs, /ai/providers, /ai/global-prompt, /ai/feedback, /ai/metrics, /ai/dynamic-analyze, /ai/user_data_context) into a dedicated sub-router file once the schemas stabilise.",
    "Frontend 'pages chaos' (audit task fbd9bd36, the memo's 'صفحه مشابهی براش هست'): the near-duplicate pages are now enumerated in duplicates_and_overlaps with a keep/merge recommendation each. No page was deleted (honoring 'no deletion'); the dedup engine consolidates DB rows (Task/Project/List) via /api/deduplication, reachable from the Dashboard (ادغام موارد مشابه) and /merge."
  ]
